1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,450
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) People think his boots are ugly.

2
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,590
They are brown.

3
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:08,250
They have yellow spots.

4
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:12,290
He does not care what other people think.

5
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,350
He loves his boots.

6
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:18,750
He thinks that they are unique.

7
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:22,610
Other boots are too plain for him.

8
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:27,170
The yellow spots make the boots special.

9
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:32,790
His mom tells him to get new boots.

10
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,550
He says no.
